@file topics.h
@brief Project specific Doxygen topics definitions.

@details
This file organises the principal Doxygen groups and documentation topics
for the µTest++ Testing Framework library, which is part of the µOS++ project.

Although named as a header, this file is not included in the build process;
it is intended exclusively as a documentation resource for Doxygen. Due to
Doxygen processing requirements, it cannot be provided as a Markdown file
or as a `.doxyfile`.

It defines the tree and the order of the documentation topics, which is
also the order of the sidebar, by including with `@include{doc}` the
hand-written Doxygen sources of the `website/doxygen` folder: the main
page (`pages/`), the file and folder pages (`files/` and `folders/`), the
topics (`topics/`, with the C++ API topics in `topics/cpp-api/`), and the
configuration macros (`macros/`).

The text of the topics is not in this file, but in the included files; this
page, for example, is `files/topics-h.dox`, whereas `topics.h` is in the
`website/doxygen` folder.
